Both Eric Raymond and Krzys' have asked for more details on Gregory
Chaitin's amazing results (which are the modern continuation of the work of
Godel and Turing).

>>                                                     The latest
>> deepening of the crater was Chaitin's 1987 proof about the
>> randomizness of mathematics at all levels (no, not the mundane stuff
