"cypherpunks-request@toad.com" and you'll be added.

We don't often discuss these issues on the Extropians list because the
topics have largely been dealt with in a lot of detail, through the posts
on digital money, crypto methods, etc., by Marc Ringuette, Hal Finney,
myself, and others. Though these issues are important, they can't just be
brought up over and over again.

